@startuml
title Command-Line Flow
start
:Parse and validate arguments;
if (Informational command?) then (yes)
  :Print help, version or plugin list;
else (no)
  :Resolve selected enabled plugins;
  :Load runtime and plugin configuration;
  if (Dry run?) then (yes)
    :Use no-op audit and unavailable database;
  else (no)
    :Initialise DBCP pool and JDBC audit;
  endif
  :Execute selected plugins with bounded parallelism;
  :Log ordered plugin summaries;
endif
:Log final status and duration;
stop
@enduml
